      en: ["San Nicolás was founded on April 14, 1748, by Rafael de Aguiar.", "The San Nicolás Agreement was signed on May 31, 1852.", "The Siderar steel plant was originally opened as Somisa in 1960.", "The Sanctuary of Our Lady of the Rosary was consecrated in 1989.", "The Municipal Theater was opened in 1908 with an Italian design.", "The city is located approximately 230 kilometers northwest of Buenos Aires."],
